    "title": "Staples subsidiary to close facility in Twinsburg, lay off nearly 100 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cliff Pinckard, cleveland.com ,\n36 minutes ago TWINSBURG, Ohio — Essendant, a subsidiary of office supply retail store Staples, has told the state of Ohio it intends to close its facility in Twinsburg, eliminating nearly 100 jobs. The company, which is headquartered in Deerfield, Illinois, submitted a Worker Adjustment and Retraining Notification (WARN) last week saying... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
